<title>USA: Alico to sell land near Florida university.</title>
<headline>Alico to sell land near Florida university.</headline>
<dateline>LABELLE, Fla. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alico Inc said on Tuesday it agreed to sell 550 acres adjacent to Florida Gulf Coast University to Miromar Development Inc for $9.35 million.</p>
<p>The contract is subject to various conditions and is expected to close in August 1997.</p>
<p>The contract calls for the payment of 25 percent of the total at the closing, with the balance paid over four years.</p>
<p>Miromar plans to use the site for residential and commercial development, Alico said. .</p>
